                                                "text": "Her children were playing in the sandbox."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81ba1e91-c1be-3e00-aee0-13d84a735a5e",
                                        "entry_id": "1fdb6eba-46b0-39b4-985a-50ead7e6133d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A box filled with sand that is shaped to form a mould for metal casting."
